<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine YPF okays bond of up to $300mln.</title>
<headline>Argentine YPF okays bond of up to $300mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's YPF SA said Wednesday its directors had approved a bond issue of up to $300 million or the equivalent in other currencies.</p>
<p>The issue will have a maturity of up to 30 years. The bonds may or may not be collateralized and may be issued with a variable or a fixed rate coupon, YPF said in a letter to the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>The issue is part of YPF's $1.0 billion negotiable bond program approved by shareholders in April this year.</p>
<p>((--Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
